user_prompt_template:
Analyze this news article:

Title: {title}
Content: {content}

Provide your analysis in the following JSON format:
{
  "summary": "concise 2-3 sentence summary",
  "importance": <integer 1-10, global significance>,
  "category": "<one of: geopolitics, technology, economy, environment, health, society, conflict, diplomacy, trade, domestic>",
  "sentiment": "<one of: positive, negative, neutral>",
  "why_it_matters": "1-2 sentence explanation of real-world impact",
  "key_entities": ["list of key people, organizations, countries, or concepts"]
}
